22:["$","p",null,{"className":"g-note","children":"GoPro describes The Remote as “total control of your camera” without listing each function, so those cells quote it. The Shutter Remote's one button takes photos and starts and stops video, and its LED confirms that the camera got the command. Voice commands are GoPro's list for the MISSION 1 series. We make Overcrank, and we've tested it on the MISSION 1 Pro only."}]
